# Business data for sap-gui-fiori-excel.flow.yaml — non-secret SAP
# identifiers, safe to commit (unlike credentials, which stay in
# `flowproof config sap` / `flowproof config fiori`, never in this file).
#
# `*.values.yaml` is gitignored (see .gitignore) because most flows' values
# files hold environment-specific test data that should not be committed.
# This one is the exception's template, not the exception: copy it to
# sap-gui-fiori-excel.values.yaml (untracked) before recording or running —
# `record`/`run` load the sibling `.values.yaml`, never the `.example`.
#
# Pulled live from MM_PUR_INFO_RECORDS_MANAGE_SRV/C_PurInfoRecordWithOrg,
# a plant-scoped row (plans/006-sap-gui-fiori-excel-config-demo.md
# "Resolved workflow choices"). If the reference tenant changes, refresh
# with the same OData shape examples/fiori/mint-test-data.sh uses —
# credentials for that query come from flowproof config or the operator's
# environment, never from this file.
SUPPLIER: "10300001"
MATERIAL: TG10
PLANT: "1010"
NET_PRICE: "12.35"
REPORT_TILE: Display Purchasing Info Record by Supplier
